  "description": "LOCFUG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H88 La4 N8 O14,4(C4 H10 O1). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.698-3.786 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.02-110.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H88La4N8O14·4(C4H10O).",
